  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : \\(P(1)=3^3+2^3\\) which is divisible by \\((3+2)=5\\) which is prime\n\\(\\therefore\\) There exists prime integer which divides \\(\\mathrm{P}(\\mathrm{n})\\)",
